  "t3fcda90": "FIRST",
  "t1061e": "CUP",
  "t1ccbd23d": "First Cup Coffee Co. was established in December 2022, with the goal to become America’s favorite roaster. Every unique roast and handcrafted beverage has been created with your satisfaction in mind. Simply put, we love our nation, our communities, and we love making your day better with every First Cup. ",
  "t53e06921": "First Cup Coffee Co. chose Pearland Texas to be its Flagship location to immediately address a need in the community. As observed in many Texas cities, the Pearland population has quickly outpaced available infrastructure. The ownership collective, comprised of three families in Pearland, wanted to help be the answer to this demand by the city to provide a much needed gathering place where people could feel at home. ",
  "t245f16a3": "The ownership of First Cup Coffee Co. has roots in the Christian faith and ministry. In fact, all of our families met in church together! We believe in supporting local assemblies as well as missional work abroad – contributing to church plants and faith building projects. ",
  "t7544d9f9": "As a core focus, the company aims to deliver a first class coffee experience, honor American culture, and exemplify moral integrity. Not to be biased, but our coffee is the best! Every roast is named after a first in our great country, and is uniquely handcrafted to pay honor to its history. From the hint of cherry in the Washington honoring our Nation’s first President, to the Mocha Java blend in the Tontine exemplifying the power sharing ideas in the first ever coffee shop in the United States. ",
  "t1a71d55b": "At First Cup Coffee Co., we believe that nothing brings people together quite like coffee, and we are honored that you are here. We look forward to serving you!",
